      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The complexity of the decision to recommend hormone replacement therapy (HRT) for the postmenopausal woman depends on the medical status of the patient, her concerns and goals, and the indications being considered. This article suggests a practical approach that leads to informed, collaborative decision making between the health care professional and patient."},
